WEBVTT

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.870
Then, the vengeful spirit of a schoolgirl
must be haunting this old dorm.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.120
I can't take it!

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:53.870
If you're so scared, why are you watching?

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:57.370
Ghost shows are part of
the summer experience.

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:57.370
So we are to believe.

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:03.330
I believe my point is clear.
Now, let us review the footage.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.160
Here it comes! Here it comes!

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.370
What is it? I'm scared!

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.000
"Unbelievable Real-life Stories"

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:47.540
It's ridiculous to be scared
by such cheap tricks.

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:50.830
Look who's talking,
Mr. Horror Movie Made Me Cry.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:52.830
I-I didn't...

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:55.700
If you don't respect ghosts, they'll curse you.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.330
Oh, not that--

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:04.120
"Ghosts, Homework, Massage"

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:10.580
N-N-N-N-N-N-Nana!
Please don't scare me like that!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.250
What a riot.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:15.160
Better listen to Yucchi.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:18.620
Sunohara House has been around
a long time, so it's totally...

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:20.700
...haunted!

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:27.410
OMG, I'm just kidding.
Don't tell me you got scared!

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:30.120
Do I need to spend the night with you?

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.250
I-I'll be fine!

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:41.580
What was that?

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.290
N-Next door?

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.830
The sound came from this direction...

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.950
M-Must've imagined it. There's no room here.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.580
"Caretaker's Room"

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:12.080
I'm here because...I'm investigating
the source of the noise. Yeah, that's it.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.370
One moment.

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.870
Oh, what's wrong, Shiina?

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:23.080
Huh? Am I at the wrong room?

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.080
I mean, isn't this Miss Caretaker's room?

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:29.160
What's the matter, Akkun?

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.700
A noise?

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:35.660
Next to your room there's a storeroom,

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.790
but no one's using it.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.410
An unused...

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:44.120
...storeroom?

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:48.040
You can't get in from the hallway.
The only door is outside.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:52.540
But the door is rusted, so Grandma
calls it our accursed storeroom.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.450
Wait, why are you in
Miss Caretaker's room, President?

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:05.040
Today, Yuzu actually asked <i>me</i>
about sleeping together!

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.000
Akkun, you, too?

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:10.290
I was told you two were watching ghost shows.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:14.540
Th-That's not it!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:15.950
Oh, my.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:21.080
Stay calm. Stay calm. It's not real. Not real.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:31.660
<i>This</i> is the accursed storeroom.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:38.750
I-It's fine. Men don't get scared by this stuff.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:46.160
H-Huh? I thought no one used it?

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.830
The lights are on, and it's clean.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.910
Someone's here!

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:06.580
Oh, it's you, Aki. What're you doing here?

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:12.830
I could say the same about you!
I could hear the noise in my room.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:17.540
You look a little too relieved
for someone who's mad.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.290
N-No, I don't.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:24.870
Oh, I get it! You thought there
was a ghost! What a riot.

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:26.790
You're too close.

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:29.370
Anyway, what is this thing?

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.830
It's a treadmill. Duh.

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:37.700
My slammin' bod doesn't come
from nowhere. It requires daily exercise.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:43.120
Wanna get some with me?
Nighttime ex-er-cise?

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.120
I-I'll pass.

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:49.450
How unlike a man to say that.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:52.580
There's actually lots of equipment here.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:55.700
Like, where I live now has no space for it.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:07:01.200
No one's using this room, so I cleaned
the place and stored it all here.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:06.000
Sis has always hated wastefulness,
so keep this secret.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.540
I see.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:09.370
S-S-Sis?!

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:16.370
What do we have here? Look at all
this stuff you bought that you won't use.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:21.790
Nothing but peppers, mushrooms, and rice
for you until you learn some discipline.

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:25.950
Please, Ayaka! Anything but that!

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:30.790
I'll do anything!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.790
What you should fear most
at Sunohara House isn't ghosts.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:34.790
It's Miss Caretaker.

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:39.370
And that's why I need
to take care of all this stuff.

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:43.410
It'd be a waste to pitch it,
so I thought you two could hold onto it.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:46.290
If it's just one or two things, sure.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:49.910
But this thing looks like it
would take up a ton of space.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.330
President!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:06.080
That does it! I absolutely refuse
to take this thing!

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.700
Self-destruction.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:12.450
Hey, now. This was expensive.
Treat it with care.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:16.700
If you care so much about it,
just keep it at your place!

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:19.580
My place is too small. I can't!

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:22.540
Ooh, I know!

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:26.910
Let's have a competition with
the equipment here. Loser takes the stuff.

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:28.790
That's ridiculous.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:35.660
You <i>have</i> always been shrimpy, huh, Yucchi?
You must not think you can win.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:39.830
I can't let that slide.
I'm not the little girl I used to be.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:43.950
Bring it on!

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.120
They're at it again...

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.830
"Sunohara House"

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:52.080
Now then, let's begin
the Nana vs. Yucchi Strength Battle.

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.500
You three will be the judges.

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.370
Get her, President!

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:57.910
I got this!

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.620
Is the President good at sports?

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:06.370
Her P.E. grades aren't bad,
but it'll be tough to match Nana- <i>sempai</i> .

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:09.000
First up is the ab roller!

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.330
This is how you use it. Watch.

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:28.200
C'mon now. A judge can't miss the action.

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.620
You have a point, but I...

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:37.700
Okay.

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:37.700
Yep.

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.450
All right! One for me!

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:45.410
Next up is the balance ball.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:49.620
It a wonder tool that develops strength
and flexibility in interior muscles.

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:52.910
Plus, you can also do this with it!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:04.830
Hey, Aki. Do your job!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.750
You're doing it on purpose!

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.330
Okay.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.330
Yep.

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:17.080
Another one for me!

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:20.450
Wait, Sumichi, your decisions
keep being wrong.

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:23.370
Sorry. She was so cute I couldn't help it.

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:25.700
Was it that kind of contest?

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:30.700
We don't even need to try the rest.
I clearly win this contest.

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:33.410
Then I pick the next piece of equipment.

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:36.700
Fine by me. What'll it be?

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:37.910
That!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.080
President, it's been five minutes.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.790
I'm just getting started.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:50.700
I see. The President's lighter,
so she has a leg up.

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:53.700
She's turned her weakness into a weapon.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.750
It's too much!

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.500
Okay.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.500
Yep.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.330
You won, President.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:17.870
Behold my skill!

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:21.660
Don't be too loud.
You'll bother the neighbors.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:23.700
Oh, Miss Caretaker.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:27.330
We were just deciding whose room
to put the treadmill in.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:33.950
But if you put it in one of their rooms,
it might damage the floor.

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:36.540
Why don't we keep it in the storeroom?

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:40.000
What was the point of all this?

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:56.830
The outer wall gets dirty so fast.
There, all done.

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:59.370
Thanks for helping, Akkun.

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:01.290
N-No problem.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.410
Her shirt turned see-through...

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:09.080
In summer it feels good to get
a little wet, doesn't it?

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:16.750
H-Hypothetically, wouldn't it be
unseemly to be seen like that?

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.830
It's fine. It's a bathing suit.

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:21.790
It's not fine for me!

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:28.000
Okay, there. I'll take care of the bucket.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:30.500
Don't worry. I'll do that part.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:34.160
B-But it's so heavy. I can't let a lady do it.

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.200
Akkun, you're so sweet.

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:40.040
Then let me borrow some of
your energy to do it.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.120
There!

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.950
I really need to train more.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:51.870
Miss Caretaker acted fine,
but her job is pretty demanding.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:55.500
If only there were something
I could do for her.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.830
Need advice?

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:03.330
Like they say, the walls have ears, the doors
have eyes, and Kazami Yuri has advice!

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:09.700
I see. Ayaka's job certainly is difficult.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.830
How about massage?

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:15.620
Massage? Good idea!

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:21.660
I happen to have a secret technique
I just perfected! I'll pass it on to you!

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:24.450
That means I need your cooperation, Sumire!

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:25.910
What's going on?

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:31.620
Why do I have to be tied up?

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:35.250
Sumire, you know you flail around.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.830
You're not doing that thing again, are you?

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:41.370
What's the big deal? It feels good, doesn't it?

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:45.450
But I won't be overcome by that massage any--

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:46.620
There!

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.660
Is this really okay?

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.200
On multiple levels...

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:58.450
It'll loosen her up all over.
It's got the Sumire guarantee!

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.080
Here, you try.

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:02.870
The trick is this spot. Push!

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:11.290
D-Don't kid yourself. As if an amateur
like you could do it for me.

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:12.580
Like this?

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:20.580
I feel like I was taught a shady technique.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:24.450
But if it can help Miss Caretaker...

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:28.000
Wait, how do I get her to get a massage?

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:31.700
It'd be weird to suddenly shout
"Let me give you a massage!"

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:34.370
I need something natural, casual...

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:41.540
M-Miss Caretaker!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:45.580
What's up? I was just about
to make your snack.

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:48.700
Here. Please take this.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.000
Is it a love letter?

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.870
No, it's nothing like that...

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.290
Coupons for a shoulder rub. Oh, my.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:02.160
I, uh... I was thinking about things
I could do to help you...

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:05.000
You're such a good boy.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:09.250
Can I redeem one right now?

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:10.620
Yes!

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:19.370
You can go a little harder if you like.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:20.830
O-Okay!

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:25.160
I can't figure out when
to move on from the shoulders.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.540
I'll just have to be bold.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:36.700
I... was just thinking about how hard you
work and how else I could help you relax.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.790
Naughty Akkun.

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:46.500
All right. Time for Yuri's secret technique!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.580
Here!

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:52.580
Huh? She's not reacting
like Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> .

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:05.040
Akkun, that's plenty.

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.540
Oh, but I wasn't--

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:11.120
I feel great. It's like you're a technician.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:16.870
I'll go all out on your snack today!

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:20.950
Was Miss Caretaker just trying
to spare my feelings?

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:27.500
It didn't work on Ayaka? How strange.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:30.080
Did you do it exactly as I taught you?

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:32.330
Stop barging in here!

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:35.450
Give it a rest alr--

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:39.830
Is Sumire just especially susceptible?

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:43.080
Or did Ayaka hold out better?

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:49.040
The girls from the pool.

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.580
O Great Nana, help us!

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:49.040
We have so much homework!

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:53.500
I don't mind, but haven't
you been procrastinating?

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:58.120
It's summer! When else can you observe
half-naked young men every day?

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.700
So you went to the pool every day.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.950
How can I fix this. Oh! I know!

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:06.040
Gotcha, Aki!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.830
Oh, it's the boy from the pool.

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:10.330
It's been a while.

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:12.700
Have some <i>fun</i> with us.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.790
This can't be anything good.

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:21.250
As an incentive, for each page you finish,
you get to have Aki for ten seconds.

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:22.500
--What?
--What?!

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:26.200
What do you mean "have" me? No way!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:31.540
But if you don't help, Aki,
their homework might not get done.

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:35.410
If we don't finish, we'll be delinquents.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:37.200
And it'll be your fault.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:42.870
No weird stuff, okay?

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.500
Yay!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:50.870
One page down!

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:52.120
Already?

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:57.790
Your focus really increases when
a younger guy is involved, huh? What a riot.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:59.500
Have your ten seconds.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.500
I-I guess it's not so bad...

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:08.370
Two pages finished.

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.370
That's 20 seconds, then.

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.000
What a cute response.

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:20.500
Wooow!

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.830
Three more pages done.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.250
Th-Thirty seconds?

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:31.910
Illegal use of hands!

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:35.660
The vitality of youth is more easily
absorbed through direct contact!

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:37.700
Are you a <i>yokai</i> or something?!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:39.950
Okay, time's up.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.200
Darn. I'll do 60 seconds next.

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:44.620
Have mercy on me.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:48.450
Their homework progress
continued in this fashion...

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.580
Mai, Mai, Mai!

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:53.790
...and their demands continued to escalate.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:56.370
We broke him.

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:59.410
Break time, then. You got a lot done.

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:00.950
Here's some tea.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.250
Nice timing, Sis!

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:08.250
We happen to be taking a break.
Join us for a game of King's Game!

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:11.450
Why King's Game? That's hilarious.

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:15.580
Why? When else will I have
an opportunity like this?

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:18.540
Mai, you <i>really</i> love younger guys, huh?

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:20.830
Are you sure you want me to join?

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:22.370
Like, yeah!

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:26.500
No ordering us to do
homework, though, please.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:29.870
Okay, but then it's back to work.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:33.580
I have an idea. I'll be right back.

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.450
Now I'm a student, too!

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:37.160
Yeah!

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:41.200
Now where is the king?

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.200
Why am <i>I</i> playing?

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:46.290
What order should I give?

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:48.410
Uchifuji looks serious!

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.200
For numbers 1 and 3. This.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.080
There it is!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.620
I'm 1.

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:55.250
I'm 3.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.750
Okay, Akkun.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:10.250
So close, so close, so close!

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:11.500
I can't do it!

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:13.290
Jealous...

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:17.370
Same order for the rest of the game.
I wanna do it with Aki, too.

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:19.410
What?!

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:21.660
Now where is the king?

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.200
I'm the king!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:27.000
King and number 2. Bring it, boy.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:28.080
Me again.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:30.580
Too bad.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.700
She smelled crazy good!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:35.040
Hello, mama!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.700
Oh, my.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:38.910
Now where is the king?

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.950
Uchifuji again? OP!

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:42.750
King and number 3.

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:45.580
Oh, it's me again.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:47.080
Mama!

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.200
Oh, my.

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:51.120
Miss Caretaker's draw.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:54.910
Oh, this time I'm the king.

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:57.370
In that case, numbers 2 and 4.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:04.910
Now that we're in this position,
it's a little embarrassing.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.950
But it's <i>mami</i> 's orders.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:09.540
What's going on here?

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:14.910
When is it my turn to be king? This stinks!

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:16.950
Aki, let's do it, too.

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:19.080
Hey.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:21.370
Oh, look how late it is.

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:25.950
I better start preparing dinner.
What about your homework?

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:33.250
I'm pooped.

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:37.410
Hey, Aki. I heard you gave
Sis a massage recently.

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:39.830
Yes. Yuri taught me.

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:41.500
A massage from a boy!

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:44.200
You'll give us one, too, right? Right?

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:46.370
Right? Right? Right? Right? Right?

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:48.120
O-Okay.

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:50.160
All right!

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:58.950
Here I go. Let's see... like this?

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:41.950
"Ear Cleaning, Lost, Fireworks"
